#: ../../user/templates/react-native-cli.md
msgid ""
"npm / pnpm / yarn / bun. Sets `packageManager`, README install/run "
"snippets, and the CI cache key. The README's \"Community CLI Setup\" "
"section substitutes the chosen install + execute commands "
